# 构建产物与本地缓存
/Target/
**/target/
**/build/
**/.gradle/
**/.kotlin/
**/local.properties
Platforms/Android/.idea/
Platforms/Android/*.iml
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# 密钥一律不入库（出包脚本在本机自签测试密钥，位置可用 LINKX_TEST_KEYSTORE 指定）
*.keystore
*.jks
*.pem
/.local-keys/

# 本地产物与临时物
/Temp/
Release/Debug/
Release/Archive/**/*.msi
Release/Archive/**/*.apk
Release/Archive/**/LinkX-*.idsig
/Release/Windows/*
/Release/Android/*
/Release/Docs/*.tar.gz
/Release/Docs/*.zip
/Release/Docs/*.sha256
/Release/*.zip

# fuzz 崩溃样本不入库；语料种子（Tests/fuzz/corpus）才是回归资产，照常跟踪
Tests/fuzz/artifacts/

# 本机才有的配置与生成标记
/.linkx-local
/.internal-excludes
.generated-copy
